{'symbol': 'PAYC', 'date': '2023-04-10 09:15:00', 'title': 'PAYCOM LAUNCHES GLOBAL HCM SOLUTION, EXPANDS REACH INTERNATIONALLY', 'text': 'OKLAHOMA CITY--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PAYCOM SOFTWARE, INC. (“PAYCOM”) (NYSE:PAYC), A LEADING PROVIDER OF COMPREHENSIVE, CLOUD-BASED HUMAN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT (“HCM”) SOFTWARE, ANNOUNCED ITS LATEST PRODUCT OFFERING, GLOBAL HCM™, ALLOWING BUSINESSES AND THEIR DOMESTIC AND INTERNATIONAL EMPLOYEES TO MANAGE THEIR HR NEEDS WITHIN ONE, EASY-TO-USE SYSTEM. WITH THIS PRODUCT, PAYCOM IS NOW ABLE TO EXPAND ACCESS TO USERS IN MORE THAN 180 COUNTRIES AND IS AVAILABLE IN 15 LANGUAGES AND DIALECTS.'}